OL,3,GNEWSAFive-year plan approved to curb
OL,4,Abinge drinking
OL,5,
OL,6,FLiverpool City Council has approved a
OL,7,Fnew five-year plan to curb binge
OL,8,Fdrinking and alcohol-related harm after
OL,9,Ffigures showed more than 67,000 adults
OL,10,Fin the city are estimated to drink to
OL,11,Fexcess.
OL,13,FAlcohol-related harm is estimated to
OL,14,Fcost Liverpool about #330m a year and
OL,15,Fis linked to thousands of hospital
OL,16,Fadmissions.
OL,18,FThe strategy aims to "rebalance" the
OL,19,Fcity's relationship with alcohol while
OL,20,Frecognising the role pubs, bars and
OL,21,Frestaurants play in the local economy
OL,22,Fand nightlife, the council said.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
